          "en": "you of course first must transform your input object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.84,
          "end": 81.75,
          "en": "or create a new user input object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.75,
          "end": 84.57300000000001,
          "en": "that then has this shape here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.19,
          "end": 88.89,
          "en": "But here in my case, this user input state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.89,
          "end": 90.9,
          "en": "which I'm managing in the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.9,
          "end": 92.75999999999999,
          "en": "already has the right shape,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.75999999999999,
          "end": 96.33,
          "en": "and therefore I can just pass this prop value like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.33,
          "end": 98.583,
          "en": "to calculate investment results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.08,
          "end": 103.68,
          "en": "And with that, I'll get my results data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.68,
          "end": 107.34,
          "en": "and for the moment I'll just console.log this results data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.34,
          "end": 110.49000000000001,
          "en": "in this component so that we can take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 111.993,
          "en": "at those results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.22,
          "end": 117.84,
          "en": "And if I save that and I open the console and I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.84,
          "end": 119.28,
          "en": "in the developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.28,
          "end": 124.17,
          "en": "I get an array with 10 elements starting at the index zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.17,
          "end": 126.09,
          "en": "And as you can see, these 10 elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.09,
          "end": 128.88,
          "en": "are for the 10 different years.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.88,
          "end": 131.7,
          "en": "And then in there you can see that for every year",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.7,
          "end": 134.67,
          "en": "I have the amount invested in that year,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.67,
          "end": 136.89,
          "en": "which of course is the same for every year",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.89,
          "end": 139.833,
          "en": "since it's simply this amount here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.67000000000002,
          "end": 143.76,
          "en": "But I then also got the interest earned in a given year,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.76,
          "end": 147.48,
          "en": "which is different for those different years.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.48,
          "end": 150.54,
          "en": "And then also the value of my investment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.54,
          "end": 152.28,
          "en": "at the end of the year,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.28,
          "end": 154.17000000000002,
          "en": "which is simply my initial investment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.17000000000002,
          "end": 157.863,
          "en": "plus any annual investments, plus that interest earned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.73,
          "end": 162.93,
          "en": "And of course also the interest earned in earlier years.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.93,
          "end": 165.09,
          "en": "So that's my investment data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.09,
          "end": 167.85,
          "en": "And if I clear this and I, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.85,
          "end": 170.01,
          "en": "change the initial investment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.01,
          "end": 172.86,
          "en": "you see that this gets recalculated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.86,
          "end": 176.91,
          "en": "but you now also see that I seem to have a strange error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.91,
          "end": 177.743,
          "en": "in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.62,
          "end": 180.81,
          "en": "The interest amount looks pretty wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.81,
          "end": 184.02,
          "en": "and the value at the end of the year does as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.02,
          "end": 185.76,
          "en": "And then from a certain point on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.76,
          "end": 189.99,
          "en": "I'm getting not a number as an interest value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.99,
          "end": 191.823,
          "en": "What's the problem here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.84,
          "end": 196.98,
          "en": "Well, the problem here is that in JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.98,
          "end": 200.55,
          "en": "when you're getting the value of an input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.55,
          "end": 203.46,
          "en": "like here for this initial investment input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 203.46,
          "end": 206.19,
          "en": "but really for any input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.19,
          "end": 210.06,
          "en": "that value when extracted as we're doing it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 210.06,
          "end": 213.75,
          "en": "will always be a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.75,
          "end": 216.32999999999998,
          "en": "Even if you set the type here to number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.32999999999998,
          "end": 219.6,
          "en": "this does not influence the type of value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.6,
          "end": 221.64,
          "en": "you're getting in JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 221.64,
          "end": 225.963,
          "en": "Instead, you will always get a value of type string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.13,
          "end": 228.96,
          "en": "And that is the problem here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 228.96,
          "end": 232.17000000000002,
          "en": "in our calculate investment results function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.17000000000002,
          "end": 234.69,
          "en": "because in there I'm then in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.69,
          "end": 239.61,
          "en": "performing mathematical calculations with strings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.61,
          "end": 243.06,
          "en": "And when using the plus operator in a calculation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.06,
          "end": 245.85,
          "en": "and one of those values is a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.85,
          "end": 249.27,
          "en": "JavaScript will not use the plus operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 249.27,
          "end": 251.49,
          "en": "to add two numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 251.49,
          "end": 253.53,
          "en": "but instead it will concatenate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 253.53,
          "end": 256.41,
          "en": "to two values as a new string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 256.41,
          "end": 259.62,
          "en": "Which leads to these super long numbers here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 259.62,
          "end": 261.39,
          "en": "which in the end are not numbers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 261.39,
          "end": 264.66,
          "en": "but simply concatenated strings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 264.66,
          "end": 268.35,
          "en": "And you can see this here in year one, in the first year.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 268.35,
          "end": 272.28,
          "en": "Here, in the end that's simply the number 15,000,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 272.28,
          "end": 274.29,
          "en": "which is my initial investment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.29,
          "end": 277.40999999999997,
          "en": "combined with the number 2,100,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.40999999999997,
          "end": 281.073,
          "en": "which is my annual investment and this interest earned here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 282.09000000000003,
          "end": 286.71,
          "en": "So these in the end are two numbers, not treated as numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 286.71,
          "end": 289.113,
          "en": "but instead concatenated as a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 290.1,
          "end": 291.63,
          "en": "And that's the problem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 291.63,
          "end": 293.82,
          "en": "That's the bug in this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 293.82,
          "end": 295.59000000000003,
          "en": "And to fix this error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 295.59000000000003,
          "end": 298.8,
          "en": "we should go back to the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 298.8,
          "end": 302.34,
          "en": "where we are storing the values entered by the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.34,
          "end": 306.39,
          "en": "and we should simply add a plus in front of new value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 306.39,
          "end": 309.3,
          "en": "Because simply adding this plus here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 309.3,
          "end": 312.99,
          "en": "will force a conversion of this string value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 312.99,
          "end": 314.523,
          "en": "to a number value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 315.81,
          "end": 319.17,
          "en": "And with this simple fix added here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 319.17,
          "end": 323.4,
          "en": "if you now reload and you change that investment here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 323.4,
          "end": 325.32,
          "en": "you'll see that this bug is gone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 325.32,
          "end": 328.563,
          "en": "and we now instead do get proper numbers here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 329.52,
          "end": 332.88,
          "en": "And with that, we now therefore get our results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 332.88,
          "end": 334.83,
          "en": "in this results component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 334.83,
          "end": 336.87,
          "en": "and we can as a next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 336.87,
          "end": 339.303,
          "en": "output these results in a table.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}